  "description": "Han Se-Young, an ordinary high school student, witnesses her childhood friend Kim Jin-Seo's suicide and subsequent resurrection as a living corpse. After coming into contact with the now-dead Jin-Seo, Se-Young becomes infected with a parasite called \"Weeper,\" gaining extraordinary physical abilities. This leads to her recruitment into the \"Secret Life Safety Bureau,\" a secret police force tasked with eliminating Weeper.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
